  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 37037694976
    m_Localized: What is a dog doing in my house?...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87113490432
    m_Localized: Well, as long as you don't bother me i dont care, now if you excuse
      me i would like to eat in calm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 126351204352
    m_Localized: By the way, I found somethin' that i don't know what is for but
      im sure you will find it usefull (you get a key from Dave)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 159645589504
    m_Localized: Still here? oh.. my... what I have to endure sometimes...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 186224893952
    m_Localized: would you? I dont know, go explore or something broski?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1463117832192
    m_Localized: "\u2026\r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1531422072832
    m_Localized: "\u2026\u2026\r\n\r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1566914273280
    m_Localized: Get out of my house, please...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
